OL,3,GNEWSAMan sought by police after Covent
OL,4,AGarden rape
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has been raped in a crowded
OL,7,Fstreet in a busy tourist area of
OL,8,Fcentral London.
OL,10,FPolice have released a CCTV image of a
OL,11,Fman they want to speak to in connection
OL,12,Fwith the attack, which happened in
OL,13,FCovent Garden in the early hours of
OL,14,FSaturday.
OL,16,FThe victim, a woman in her 20s, was
OL,17,Fapproached by a man, who was unknown to
OL,18,Fher, at about 05:20 BST as she walked
OL,19,Fthrough Shaftesbury Avenue, Cambridge
OL,20,FCircus and Drury Lane.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
